  "launches": [
    {
      "id": 81058,
      "title": "ClaimSorted: Hassle-free insurance claims with AI",
      "tagline": "Have you ever wondered why it takes ages to get your money back when you claim on insurance?",
      "body": "**TL:DR: We help insurers manage claims efficiently by outsourcing claim operations to us. We then use AI to make the process faster and cheaper.**\n\n**🙋 Ask: looking for intros to insurance companies.**\n\n### **Problem**\n\nIf you've ever submitted an insurance claim and it took ages to get your money back, here's why:\n\n**Insurers outsource claims** to claim outsourcing agencies, known as **Third Party Administrators (TPAs)**.\n\nImagine a huge warehouse with **thousands of people using pen and paper** to process millions of claims. That’s why it's so slow.\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=81058&key=user_uploads/548277/a54f1ee1-38f1-4433-93da-1b85a152e545)\n\n### **Solution**\n\nAt [ClaimSorted](https://claimsorted.com/), we are an **AI-first TPA for insurance claims**. We automate fraud checks, compliance, claim decision-making, and **deliver payouts in minutes**. Our AI is paired with a team of experts to ensure accuracy.\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=81058&key=user_uploads/548277/e9bb2909-eee6-492c-a443-514bf23284b7)\n\n### **Team**\n\nWe **previously built an insurance company** and know the struggles of working with TPAs.\n\nWe aim to make every claim a positive experience for customers and drive cost efficiencies for insurers.\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=81058&key=user_uploads/548277/f39d3973-76c7-4a63-a7c8-97d28d79b02c)\n\n_Fun fact, _[_German_](https://www.linkedin.com/in/german-mikulski/)_ was the best man at _[_Pavel_](https://linkedin.com/in/pavel-gertsberg)_'s wedding_\n\n### **Ask:**\n\n**If you know any insurance companies in the US, UK, or EU, please email us at [founders@claimsorted.com](mailto:founders@claimsorted.com)**",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/L5O-claimsorted-hassle-free-insurance-claims-with-ai",
      "votes": 27,
      "created_at": "2024-05-23T15:06:47.010Z"
    }
  ]
